{"steam_appid":4150860,"steam_name":"The Loopler","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4150860/161094812/faeff50265d3179977c3b5bb33fc59bfa85495ac/1789163175/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1789163833","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228360/07d5ee257e68c24d64715a07141b52f4e125d696/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1789163833","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/a4de7b477a18a7289e9739fef798c4b6bc0fac25/ss_a4de7b477a18a7289e9739fef798c4b6bc0fac25.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789248956","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/d10bbd78dd485301d5413793c05098771d8ab031/ss_d10bbd78dd485301d5413793c05098771d8ab031.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789248956","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/4c2a5b343fb0f28601d81cdbdf0c6d5f3320aca0/ss_4c2a5b343fb0f28601d81cdbdf0c6d5f3320aca0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789248956","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/4482ce46cc7b9c7ece7c8937e1b2ade97afd56b5/ss_4482ce46cc7b9c7ece7c8937e1b2ade97afd56b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789248956","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/c080ea598593f44334c7c7d8feb0ec0288389cbd/ss_c080ea598593f44334c7c7d8feb0ec0288389cbd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789248956"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Loopler is a roguelite deckbuilder about a slot car driving in mesmerizing loops. Pick cards, place gates, and collect charms. Settle into the loop as numbers go up and dopamine fills your brain. See how far you can go in the pursuit of infinity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/6d8e2fae1f20e0a927b769526b61722a.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=960 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/6d8e2fae1f20e0a927b769526b61722a.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/6d8e2fae1f20e0a927b769526b61722a.mp4?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/37ac3a2656ea6fb6126677d808e56802.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/37ac3a2656ea6fb6126677d808e56802.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/37ac3a2656ea6fb6126677d808e56802.mp4?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Variety: </strong>With a heap of different game-changing cards, create synergies and manipulate the ways you reach the goal. Will you go for big scores or will you chase insane speeds?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft your build: </strong>Pick your cards, discover synergies, and put together a winning build. Watch the cards jump as they trigger from many different sources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Effects:</strong> Cards can give you a bunch of different effects: from increasing passive multipliers, to spawning ghost cars, to rolling the dice for a jackpot, to triggering other cards altogether.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/c04e95eedbe1f548b9de414d38f15ecf.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=960 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/c04e95eedbe1f548b9de414d38f15ecf.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/eeffa1192b1d81ab6503c6a1eb3f010a.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/eeffa1192b1d81ab6503c6a1eb3f010a.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/eeffa1192b1d81ab6503c6a1eb3f010a.mp4?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gate Madness: </strong>Place gates on the track to enable even more synergies and enhance the craziness that unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimise Placement:</strong> Each track comes with a number of gate placement slots. Figure out the best combo order of gates to get the most out of each gate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Reaction:</strong> Trigger a chain of reaction of passive multipliers, unique effects, and compounding synergies that turn a normal run into a fireworks show.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/ab2fbf3b55d4c3c7a2280fc845f3e1dc.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=960 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/ab2fbf3b55d4c3c7a2280fc845f3e1dc.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/19427589582eb0685e7b6db425d7c2b7.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/19427589582eb0685e7b6db425d7c2b7.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/19427589582eb0685e7b6db425d7c2b7.mp4?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Charms: </strong>Discover and stack powerful passive Charms, which further change how your run plays out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero to Hero: </strong>Tip the scales from a modest drive into a screen tearing powerhouse of dopamine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash full potential:</strong> Synergize your build between cards, gates, and charms to unlock the true ecstasy of The Loopler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/5dcf225da08f706273b9cb93e3cb94f7.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=960 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/5dcf225da08f706273b9cb93e3cb94f7.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/b10b6c3d66a6789d1700ae88485aa641.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/b10b6c3d66a6789d1700ae88485aa641.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/b10b6c3d66a6789d1700ae88485aa641.mp4?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Push the car beyond its limits. Fine-tune each aspect of your build, max out your cards and gates, and assemble the god run to see if you can reach infinity. Prepare for the challenge accordingly, you will need it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/c52931446b0c52a3e081b815f9f4b67c.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" width=960 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/c52931446b0c52a3e081b815f9f4b67c.webm?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/c52931446b0c52a3e081b815f9f4b67c.mp4?t=1789248956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>9 Cars, each with their own identity and effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>9 Tracks with different looks and layouts to fully challenge your build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>5 difficulty modes to make it even harder to go infinite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>Daily and weekly challenges, with a variety of optional leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>50 Cards to draft</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>30 Gates to place</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>70 Charms</strong> <strong>to collect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>Chill soundtrack by Pulsewith (Justin Skomarovsky)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.webp?t=1789248956\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/838926b91453818446d036d5b8f4d0cb.poster.avif?t=1789248956\" class=\"bb_img\" width=40 height=32 /></picture></span><strong>Infinity awaits</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> no<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Racing","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Mheep"],"publishers":["Mheep","Zero Percent"],"release_date":"11 Sep, 2026"}